{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53890","headline":"采莲（一作「花」） · 张祜","name":"采莲（一作「花」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常闻浣纱女，复有弄珠姬。\n（见《後村大全集》卷一七七《诗话续集》卷一引李康成《玉台後集》引）（按：《玉台後集》收诗迄於天宝末，不当收入张祜诗，後村所录，未详因何致误，今姑存此。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}